# Keep the build context small and never ship host artefacts into images:
# host node_modules (macOS symlinks into the pnpm store), build outputs and
# any .env file (a stray apps/client/.env.local would be baked into `next build`).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/src/generated
.git
.github
.cursor
.claude
*.md
docs
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
!.env.production.example
apps/server/uploads
